    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "43937fa3-bbce-4406-9c1a-f4e4f9ce08d2",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Friend&apos;s Contact - Mission 3",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110488893990",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository efae226f-f38a-4cac-b0bf-c66d4463f617).Image",
        "Description": "Hey man, I need another favour.\r\rI know you are problably busy, but you recently had a contract in Tokyo right? Since you are already in Japan, can you head north for me?\r\rThere&apos;s a high-class hospital up there with two agents there that I need taken care of. They signed in  a couple of days ago, and are about to leave tommorow. Can you eliminate them for me? I got $50,000 cash. I don&apos;t know if it&apos;s enough though. To cover up my tracks, can you get rid of the hopspital director as well?\r\rPlease?",
